      "name": "D13",
      "label": "GPIO11 (Led active high)",
      "codeName": "D13",
      "capabilities": [
        "digital_output",
        "pwm_output",
        "led_high"
      ],
      "notes": "PIN_LED (silkscreen D13) — onboard status LED, active-high. Confirmed via Zephyr's adafruit_itsybitsy_rp2040.dts leds node (gpios = <&gpio0 11 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>) and Adafruit's own pinouts guide (\"the little red LED... It is controllable in CircuitPython code using the pin board.LED. It is on RP2040 pin GPIO11\")."
    },
    {
      "name": "D2",
