    {
      "name": "D17",
      "label": "GPIO17 (Led Neopixel)",
      "codeName": "D17",
      "capabilities": [
        "digital_output",
        "led_neopixel"
      ],
      "notes": "PIN_NEOPIXEL (silkscreen D17) — onboard single status NeoPixel (WS2812), output-only data line. Power is separately gated by GPIO16 (NEOPIXEL_POWER, must be driven HIGH to enable — not exposed as a pin, see pins_arduino.h). Confirmed via Adafruit's own pinouts guide, CircuitPython's pins.c (NEOPIXEL -> pin_GPIO17), and Zephyr's adafruit_itsybitsy_rp2040.dts onboard ws2812 node (gpio0 pin 17)."
    },
